he through line"]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Turning coursework into practical experience."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"My projects connect circuit analysis, firmware, and mechanical integration: reading environmental sensors with an ESP32, modeling flyback protection in LTspice, and integrating electric drivetrains."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"I also founded OurWay, a campus social platform built with Next.js, React, TypeScript, and Supabase, and I am developing an original action game. Leading a community service project as an Eagle Scout taught me to organize work and follow through with a team."}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"about-focus shell","aria-labelledby":"about-focus-title","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":[["$","span",null,{}]," Current focus"]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"about-focus-title","children":"Closing the gap between a clean model and a real system."}]]}],["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"01"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"What I'm practicing"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"ESP32 sensor bring-up, a 48 V electric drivetrain, full-stack product development, circuit simulation, and practical packaging around real constraints."}]]}],["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"02"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Where I can contribute"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Electrical engineering internships and collaborations involving embedded bring-up, hardware validation, power integration, prototyping, and clear technical documentation."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"about-principles shell","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-intro","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":[["$","span",null,{}]," Working principles"]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"How I approach a hard problem."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Simple habits that keep complex builds understandable and improve the quality of every iteration."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"principle-grid","children":[["$","article","01",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"01"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Make it observable"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A system is easier to debug when every important state can be measured, logged, or inspected."}]]}],"$Le","$Lf"]}]]}]]}],"$L10"]
